OL,3,GNEWSACat lovers to head out on charity
OL,4,Awalking tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FCat lovers will head out on a guided
OL,7,Fwalking tour of Brighton to meet some
OL,8,Fof the city's feline residents and
OL,9,Fraise money for an animal rescue
OL,10,Fcharity.
OL,12,FOrganisers said participants on
OL,13,FSunday's Brighton Cat Tour could expect
OL,14,Fto see about 25 of the animals during a
OL,15,F3km walk around the city, with proceeds
OL,16,Fsupporting a local shelter.
OL,18,FThe tour begins at 10:15 BST and will
OL,19,Ftake people through neighbourhoods
OL,20,Fwhere owners have volunteered to
OL,21,Fintroduce visitors to their pets.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
